      'Check balance: the ruler should rest level with empty cups. Adjust string lengths to balance if needed.',
      'Weigh objects using pennies: place an object in one cup, add pennies to the other cup until balanced. Record "X pennies = this object."',
      'Calculate: 1 penny = 2.5 grams. Convert your penny measurements to grams. How close were your estimates before measuring?',
